    "supported": "Ultrasound alone achieves strong predictive accuracy for post-calendering anode thickness (R2 = 0.835 Ridge, 0.527 StageAware) without knowledge of mechanical roll gap. For anode density, linear Ridge demonstrates positive multimodal fusion gain (R2 = 0.803 -> 0.835). However, the neural StageAwareProcessModel does not outperform its tabular baseline on anode density (R2 = 0.844 -> 0.719) due to finite sample size (N=30).",
